Running it
Three commands get a song with no API key: create a venv, install requirements.txt, run pipeline.py with a prompt.

git clone -b codex/complete-pendant https://github.com/Pranjal101Shrivastava/pendant_music
cd pendant_music
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate          # Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt

python pipeline.py "sad lo-fi, 80 BPM"     # -> outputs/sad-lo-fi-80-bpm/song.mid
python pipeline.py --all                   # every prompt in prompts.json
python -m pytest                           # tests, no paid calls
Offline or OpenAI. With no OPENAI_API_KEY, every agent is played by the rule-based stand-ins in agents/offline.py. With a key, the default --provider auto switches to OpenAI:

export OPENAI_API_KEY=...
python pipeline.py "upbeat funk, 110 BPM" --provider openai --mode autonomous
