Outputs
Each prompt gets its own folder named after the prompt (outputs/sad-lo-fi-80-bpm/) holding three files.

File

Contents

song.mid

One track per instrument with its General MIDI sound; drums on channel 10; tempo and time signature set. Open it in any DAW

song.json

blueprint (title, style, key, mode, tempo, sections with chords, energy and instruments, GM programs) and song (every note per instrument as pitch, start_beat, duration, velocity)

report.json

Prompt, provider, bars, instrument order, total model calls, calls per agent, attempts and code repairs per instrument, feedback to the composer, blueprint revisions, and each critic round's verdict, scores and issues

